0,'2026-09-07 12:16:23','2026-09-07 06:46:23','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Entrepreneur Spotlight collects the reporting our features desk publishes on this beat — profiles, analysis and interviews with the people closest to the decisions. New stories are added every week, and the archive below runs to the oldest piece we have filed here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have a story for this section? Our editors read every pitch. <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/about/contact/\">Send it to the newsroom</a> — nominations for founders and chief executives are welcome, and so are corrections.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Entrepreneur Spotlight','A closer look at one entrepreneur, every week.','inherit','closed','closed','','23-revision-v1','','','2026-09-07 12:16:23','2026-09-07 06:46:23','',23,'http://localhost:8080/?p=658',0,'revision','',0),(659,0,'2026-09-07 12:16:24','2026-09-07 06:46:24','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Founder Features collects the reporting our features desk publishes on this beat — profiles, analysis and interviews with the people closest to the decisions. New stories are added every week, and the archive below runs to the oldest piece we have filed here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have a story for this section? Our editors read every pitch. <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/about/contact/\">Send it to the newsroom</a> — nominations for founders and chief executives are welcome, and so are corrections.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Founder Features','Extended profiles of the founders our editors are watching.','inherit','closed','closed','','19-revision-v1','','','2026-09-07 12:16:24','2026-09-07 06:46:24','',19,'http://localhost:8080/?p=659',0,'revision','',0),(660,0,'2026-09-07 12:16:24','2026-09-07 06:46:24','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Startup Features collects the reporting our features desk publishes on this beat — profiles, analysis and interviews with the people closest to the decisions. New s